WEBVTT

NOTE Generated by HOOKLINE — positioned for vertical safe area.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.955 line:82% align:center
"Everybody tells you
the algorithm decides

00:00:02.955 --> 00:00:05.599 line:82% align:center
who wins" is not dead,
and you will notice

00:00:05.599 --> 00:00:07.684 line:82% align:center
I opened this
episode with it,

00:00:07.684 --> 00:00:10.882 line:82% align:center
because I practice
what I am telling you.

00:00:11.939 --> 00:00:14.127 line:82% align:center
Second, is there
an open loop.

00:00:14.127 --> 00:00:16.466 line:82% align:center
Something the sentence
sets up and does

00:00:16.466 --> 00:00:17.804 line:82% align:center
not immediately close.

00:00:18.279 --> 00:00:21.433 line:82% align:center
Your brain does not
let you scroll away

00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:23.227 line:82% align:center
from an unclosed loop.

00:00:23.528 --> 00:00:26.168 line:82% align:center
This is not a trick,
it is just how

00:00:26.168 --> 00:00:27.498 line:82% align:center
attention works.

00:00:28.776 --> 00:00:31.810 line:82% align:center
Third, is there
something concrete in the

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:33.133 line:82% align:center
first ten seconds.

00:00:33.406 --> 00:00:35.692 line:82% align:center
A number, a name,
a specific thing.
